{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/a_sch_ground01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/a_sch_ground01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve01",
      "hash64": "9E72D8A91F035100",
      "text": "操场很宽阔，所以就算派出\\n很大的宝可梦也没问题！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve02",
      "hash64": "9E72DBA91F035619",
      "text": "只要盯着暴鲤龙的脸，\\n就会被它的威吓降低攻击哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve22",
      "hash64": "9E6C6BA91EFE2C1B",
      "text": "听说热带龙因为太喜欢水果，\\n以至于脖子上都结出了水果！\\r\\n……这怎么可能！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve24",
      "hash64": "9E6C71A91EFE364D",
      "text": "食堂的料理是用这块田地\\n产出的食材制作的哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve25",
      "hash64": "9E6C70A91EFE349A",
      "text": "接下来培育什么呢？\\n这是培育农作物和宝可梦共通的烦恼啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve26",
      "hash64": "9E6C6FA91EFE32E7",
      "text": "摩托蜥锃亮锃亮的，好惹人爱！\\n能消除学习积累的疲劳～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve27",
      "hash64": "9E6C6EA91EFE3134",
      "text": "开始提供摩托蜥疗愈了！\\n你想看多久就看多久吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve29",
      "hash64": "9E6C64A91EFE2036",
      "text": "我和泥驴仔跑了场马拉松！\\n它的持久力真是太强了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve49",
      "hash64": "9E8068A91F0ED00C",
      "text": "接下来我要和朋友\\n来场宝可梦对战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_eve50",
      "hash64": "9E7D6BA91F0C9F4E",
      "text": "和朋友对战的话，彼此都知根知底，\\n所以预判对方的行动是很重要的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni03",
      "hash64": "FBC87D1909BB1307",
      "text": "总觉得睡不着觉，\\n所以我正在校园里散步呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni05",
      "hash64": "FBC87B1909BB0FA1",
      "text": "之前妮莫在操场上\\n连赢了３０场宝可梦对战！\\r\\n不愧是冠军级！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni06",
      "hash64": "FBC8781909BB0A88",
      "text": "妮莫是学生会长，也是冠军，\\n而且成绩还很优秀！\\r\\n她有没有不擅长做的事呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni09",
      "hash64": "FBC8771909BB08D5",
      "text": "为了让自己在道馆消除紧张，\\n我正看着对战场地做表象训练呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni16",
      "hash64": "FBCBEA1909BE0215",
      "text": "为了让鲤鱼王进化成暴鲤龙，\\n我可是费了不少周折哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni21",
      "hash64": "FBC1F31909B5BCDB",
      "text": "睡着了都在笑的耿鬼，\\n真是太招人爱了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "a_sch_ground01_ni22",
      "hash64": "FBC1F41909B5BE8E",
      "text": "偶尔会有发型奇特的学生\\n从校长室走出来哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
